n 其中 CONTINUE 为高亮状态。\n 镜头为轻微高角度俯拍，画面像游戏主菜单首页。\n2-5 秒\n 光标点击 CONTINUE。\n 镜头快速推近主角右脚，展开装备界面。\n 基于 [Picture 2] 的界面风格，右侧弹出标题清晰的装备面板：\nMAG-STEP LOADOUT\n 磁力鞋鞋底自动分层展开，露出 活塞、线圈、导轨、金属结构，机械结构拆解展示要自然清晰。\n 角色外形仍严格保持 [Picture 1] 一致。\n5-9 秒\n 镜头绕到主角左侧。\n 基于 [Picture 2] 的 UI 风格，出现装备升级网格界面，清晰显示模块名称：\nSOLE / COIL / HEEL / GAUNTLET\n 不同模块依次切换，高亮、展开、升级。\n 机械零件自然拆解、重组并锁定，局部出现短暂橙色火花。\n 角色、机械手甲、鞋体结构必须稳定，不变形。", 1344, 768, 124, "match"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 270, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 271, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"name": "audio_vae", "link": 272, "label": "audio_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "audio_vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "link": 314, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "link": 313, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_2", "label": "ref_images.ref_image_2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_videos.ref_video_0", "link": 319, "label": "ref_videos.ref_video_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_video_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_videos.ref_video_1", "label": "ref_videos.ref_video_1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_video_1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0", "label": "ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "ref_video_audio_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_audios.ref_audio_0", "link": 326, "label": "ref_audios.ref_audio_0", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "ref_audio_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_audios.ref_audio_1", "label": "ref_audios.ref_audio_1", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "ref_audio_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"},